{"2547570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Miss Peach", "steam_appid": 2547570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "《Miss Peach》is a pixel stealth strategy puzzle game<br>You will play the role of a police officer - Jing Shu, searching for your missing son. During the search process, you are caught up in a strange incident: you are trapped in the house of Duo. Here, investigate more truth while protecting yourself.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547570/extras/4aa43753dd815c9bddf3206672ee02cf.avif?t=1696496707\" width=640 height=360 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roger Nissim</h2>You feel like it's difficult to move forward in the process of exploration, and anything that can be searched cannot be missed. However, when faced with danger, I have no strength to fight back. Why are they so repelled and why do they seem so guilty?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547570/extras/2bdfea539385afdcd596bec549ac24fe.avif?t=1696496707\" width=640 height=360 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step by step</h2>Gradually adapt to the switching and interaction of dual roles, and as time passes, make the decisions you think are &quot;right&quot;. With the help of another character, find more clues.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547570/extras/53f252eb0b66e2415446dfea085adeb8.avif?t=1696496707\" width=640 height=360 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple outcomes</h2>Is it to leave after rescuing my son, or to continue exploring incomprehensible mysteries, or to learn more about someone, or even to make everything seem like it never happened.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app